      "message": "This seems to work:\n\n```\n+/// Trait to check containment of one range within another\n+pub(crate) trait RangeExt {\n+    /// Returns true if \u0027self\u0027 is contained within the \u0027other\u0027 range\n+    fn is_within(\u0026self, other: \u0026Self) -\u003e bool;\n+}\n+\n+impl\u003cT: core::cmp::Ord + Copy\u003e RangeExt for Range\u003cT\u003e {\n+    fn is_within(\u0026self, other: \u0026Self) -\u003e bool {\n+        \u0026(max(self.start, other.start)..min(self.end, other.end)) \u003d\u003d self\n+    }\n+}\n+\n\n```",
